# Generated Store-serialization contract. The body between the braces must stay
# strict JSON: mail/tests/test_mock_server_contract.py parses it with
# json.loads. Prettier's "as-needed" quote props and trailing commas turn it
# into valid JS but invalid JSON, which silently breaks that test (it did once
# already). The file's own header says DO NOT EDIT BY HAND; this makes the
# formatter honour it too. Mirrored in eslint.config.mjs.
#
# A .prettierrc.json `overrides` entry pinning quoteProps/trailingComma was
# tried and rejected: it does keep the body valid JSON, but prettier still
# collapses the generator's one-entry-per-line arrays (17 lines), so every
# regeneration would re-expand them and fail `prettier --check`. Ignoring the
# file is the stable choice for a generated artifact.
addons/mail/static/tests/mock_server/contract/store_shapes.js
# Same shape: json.loads reads its body in odoo/tools/tests/test_view_ir_fixture.py.
addons/web/static/tests/views/view_ir_fixture.js
